{"id":"n41273-1-6","stage":4,"title":"낭패 · 狼狈","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41273-1-6-1","ko":"주문한 물건은 잘 받았어?","zh":"你收到的东西是对的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주문한","meaning":"订购，预定，下单","explanation":"주문하다：订购，预定，下单；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주문하다","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91768","senseId":"1","lemma":"주문하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문한","audio":"/audio/64aec70c7c232b702260.mp3"}},{"text":"물건은","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건은","audio":"/audio/2e3ce52c4ab7fb078a0e.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"받았어?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았어","audio":"/audio/f28745e04b72548ccb6f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc82df55affb977b","term":"주문하다","zh":"订购，预定，下单","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3","entryId":"91768","definition":"向相关制造商或销售商告知自己所需要的物品种类、数量、模样、规格等，并叮嘱对方按要求制造或送货。","pronunciation":["주ː문하다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f1d232b38da76afcbf2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41273-1-6-2","ko":"낭패야. 주문을 잘못해서 다른 물건이 왔거든.","zh":"糟了，因为点错了，收到的其实是别的东西。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"낭패야.","meaning":"狼狈，糟糕，失败","explanation":"낭패：狼狈，糟糕，失败；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"낭패","audio":"/audio/a31703960aff8e0fe53a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41273","senseId":"1","lemma":"낭패","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낭패야","audio":"/audio/f4528f7ba3c6b2637d22.mp3"}},{"text":"주문을","meaning":"订购，订货","explanation":"주문：订购，订货；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주문","audio":"/audio/d64a64f06a81e5482e98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25943","senseId":"1","lemma":"주문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문을","audio":"/audio/08e9f12cfef042ee4944.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못해서","meaning":"弄错，搞错","explanation":"잘못하다：弄错，搞错；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못해서","audio":"/audio/56ec805725faded9f4a7.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"물건이","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건이","audio":"/audio/467d4d94d33d4871f929.mp3"}},{"text":"왔거든.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔거든","audio":"/audio/5f43a9b5a9761c33d5e4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a31703960aff8e0f","term":"낭패","zh":"狼狈，糟糕，失败","audio":"/audio/a31703960aff8e0fe53a.mp3","entryId":"41273","definition":"事情未按计划或期望的那样发展而陷入窘境。","pronunciation":["낭ː패"]},{"id":"d64a64f06a81e548","term":"주문","zh":"订购，订货","audio":"/audio/d64a64f06a81e5482e98.mp3","entryId":"25943","definition":"向相关制造商或销售商告知自己所需要的物品的种类、数量、模样、规格等，并叮嘱对方按要求制造或送货的事宜或指其内容。","pronunciation":["주ː문"]},{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"弄错，搞错","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"使不合适。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73898ca0041d32682895.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.149,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41273","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你收到的东西是对的吗？","糟了，因为点错了，收到的其实是别的东西。","怎么这么兴奋啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你收到的东西是对的吗？","糟了，因为点错了，收到的其实是别的东西。","怎么这么兴奋啊？"],"answer":1}]}
